  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/BlackFlames_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>Black Flame gathers around you like a cloud, bearing you aloft and enabling you to soar in the manner of your draconic forebears.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, you gain a <strong>Fly</strong> speed of <strong>5</strong>. If you already have a <strong>Fly</strong> speed, it increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p><p>At the start of your turn, you may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> or take <strong>1 Wound</strong> to sustain this effect.</p>",
